#                       (recognition #51; the tray's monotone
#                        growth IS H_mirror's dimension expansion
#                        at the operational altitude),
#                      [[architecture-peer-learns-by-crystal-vocabulary-expansion]]
#                       (each settlement extends A_peer; the
#                        substrate's vocabulary IS the Bauchladen
#                        tray's accumulation),
#                      [[architecture-spectral-db-autopoietic-memory]]
#                       (the librarian altitude is the autopoietic
#                        layer above @bauchladen; this shard names
