#                 uuid/spectral.mirror (the uuid_spectral identity
#                  carrier the shard layer of @glass already uses;
#                  the navigable-identity discipline crystals
#                  inherit at the shard altitude),
#                 epistemologic/cybernetic/autopoiesis.mirror
